# Exo Shaders (GPL-3.0-or-later). Build outputs:
proxy/build/
proxy/build-x86/
engine/out/
bin/
obj/
*.log

# Game content and third-party binaries are never committed...
out/
*.db
*.usmap
*.dll
# ...except the native files built from proxy/ and kept for the release build (engine/prebuilt/SOURCE.md).
!engine/prebuilt/**/*.dll
!engine/prebuilt/**/*.exe
